                                "sense_id": "de441a17-b861-3afe-a625-cee3abc5470d",
                                "text": "With these words he gave him a letter directed, as he had said, but not sealed, which Horatio, after he had manifested the sense he had of so unhoped an obligation, reminded him of."
                            },
